    "task": "portrait-segmentation",
    "description": "Segments the prominent person from the background in one image locally in the browser with Google's official MediaPipe Selfie Segmenter and returns a transparent PNG plus an alpha-mask PNG.",
    "intendedUses": [
      "Removing or replacing a webcam background.",
      "Applying portrait-only visual effects to selfies and video-call frames."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "Segments the whole prominent person, not only the face.",
      "Fine hair, motion blur, occlusion, poor lighting, and multiple people can produce inaccurate edges.",
      "The output is a visual estimate and must not be used for identification, safety-critical decisions, or biometric analysis."
    ]
  },
